		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Crimson devil that carries reams of pre-written contracts, which it eagerly offers. Signing one dooms a mortal soul to the Hells.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 ribbon of paper (close/near) +6 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Infernal Contract</strong>. A mortal can negotiate a price for singing their True Name. Typical offers include a wish (as the spell) or obtaining a devilish servant.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
